  "description": "\"Special rules of escape room games, find out the hidden past and truth of the guests\"\n\nShim Woo-jae, a man who was forcibly hired as a 'helper' in an escape room. You have to help the guests who have been brought there and escape with your life. However, the helper is given an additional secret mission to uncover the past and truth about the guest... Find out the story you don't want to tell.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=803541), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?originalProductId=490026)",
